Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 03:48:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 6/9] Spike: one statement for each half of a node's
 competition read

The deep crown's Q and q are scaled by leaf area and density inside the one
expression each, rather than recorded and multiplied after; and the field's
height weights and their slopes share one z^eta. A node's read drops from 11
statements to 5. The forward values are unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LFsPxk1yy62LrcCbtZUVeB
